  "design-enterprise-pt1": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "lines": [
        "Project One: We split ourselves into teams mixed with different disciplines.  Our team included: Digital Interaction Design, Interior Design, Graphic Design, and Textile Design.  We were to analyse an existing company and break down its business strategies and plans.  We then had to look into any improvements that could be made for the company.  We chose 'Clothes Doctor', a clothing repair service and clothing maintenance provider."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "src": "/images/archive/design-enterprise-pt1/01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "lines": [
        "A link to our chosen company's website:  https://clothes-doctor.com/?campaignid=14238557219&adgroupid=123074167622&adid=538455796704&gclid=CjwKCAiAp8iMBhAqEiwAJb94z3w4yZBIvwQw2MOiEfG-fmH8uk1PeW_Xjipk3UnLXNLVTe_r2EiH2xoCaT8QAvD_BwE"
